","3e36f39a-fdb0-4e5f-b705-a67efb629a00"],"coverAssetId":""},{"id":"fld-1773123931528","title":"New Folder","photos":["8727b8eb-dd2d-40e3-99d0-e9ffb6d1ac00","912ffdaa-7dce-4a9a-cd41-2ce3fa5f8200","d394b295-a88d-4b4c-95fe-056171b0e800","d4ad75dd-c6f4-470f-9648-9293dee27c00"],"coverAssetId":""}],"location":"Iceland","subtitle":"A photographic journey into the volatile interior of Iceland, where geothermal heat fractures the earth and glacial silence presses against it from all sides.","coverAssetId":"cf786493-77cd-48cf-aa19-2804d79fed00"}],"description":"Iceland. Guadalupe Peak. New Orleans. The locations accumulate not as destinations collected but as sites of patient attendance — places where the work of arriving gives way to the slower work of waiting. Waiting for light to shift across volcanic stone, for weather to break or deepen, for the particular moment that retroactively justifies every mile of the journey. Each expedition is a deliberate act of going somewhere in order to be still.","coverAssetId":"aa1e2b18-8716-4ce7-b120-3f365aa7cb00"},{"id":"pw-frame","type":"Home Terrain","title":"Beyond the Frame","camera":"GFX 100S II","format":"Digital","location":"North Texas","subtitle":"The near distance","galleries":[{"id":"gal-1772505442065","title":"Test Collection","photos":[],"folders":[],"subtitle":"","coverAssetId":""}],"description":"North Texas landscape — the land you drive past every day and never stop for. Palo Duro. The Trinity bottomlands. The Llano Estacado at golden hour. What’s here when you look.","coverAssetId":""},{"id":"pw-moment","type":"Figures in the Threshold","title":"Beyond the Moment","camera":"GFX 100S II","format":"Digital","location":"Various","subtitle":"The ones who also chose to be out there","galleries":[],"description":"People in landscape. Climbers. Hikers. The WE CLIMB community. Figures who remind us that the wilderness is not empty — it is where we go to remember who we are.","coverAssetId":""},{"id":"pw-shutter","type":"Film · Konica Hexar","title":"Beyond the Shutter","camera":"Konica Hexar","format":"Film","location":"Various","subtitle":"The slower eye","galleries":[],"description":"The Konica Hexar sees differently. Grain, patience, the commitment of analog — no spray and pray, no instant review. One frame at a time. One chance to mean it.","coverAssetId":""}]}